   "#36557"
  ]
 },
 "scope_notes": "This is explicitly a non-mergeable draft demo meant to illustrate the architectural simplifications of removing AssumeUTXO and to serve as a reference for smaller, separable PRs.",
 "changed_since_previous": "Dependency #36601 has been merged upstream; the branch was rebased and adjusted across 35 commits.",
 "card": "This draft demo PR completely removes AssumeUTXO snapshot loading, background sync, and multi-chainstate architecture across Bitcoin Core to demonstrate potential simplifications. It is not intended for merge, but serves as a concrete reference point for carved-out sub-proposals such as dropping background sync or removing dynamic cache resizing. The change eliminates extensive multi-chainstate edge cases across validation, block storage, pruning, and P2P download logic, citing maintenance overhead, low adoption, and recent performance gains in standard initial block download. Prerequisite #36601 is merged upstream.",
